<title>JAPAN: Dai Nippon Toryo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Dai Nippon Toryo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 31.80		vs	   29.95</p>
<p> Operating	    1.18		vs	  706    million</p>
<p> Current		1.05		vs	  622    million</p>
<p> Net		  449    million    vs	  275    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.49 yen	  vs	    2.14 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    129 million	  vs	 129 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Dai Nippon Toryo Co Ltd is a paint maker belonging to the Mitsubishi group.</p>
